MMTR (Multiplayer MTR) — Notice of Derivation
===================================================

MMTR is a derivative project built upon:
- Minecraft Transit Railway (MTR) 4.0.5 for Minecraft 1.20.4
  https://github.com/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/Minecraft-Transit-Railway (MIT)
- Transport Simulation Core (TSC) @ ce3a509082 (baseline bundled with MTR 4.0.5)
  https://github.com/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/Transport-Simulation-Core (MIT)
- Minecraft-Mappings / Minecraft-Mod-API-Tools (MIT)

All upstream copyright and MIT license notices are preserved in the
corresponding subfolders (see engine/LICENSE, game/LICENSE and their source headers).
This project: mod id "mmtr"; resource namespace "mtr" and Java packages "org.mtr.*"
are intentionally retained for asset compatibility (see docs/03-MMTR-架构决策与里程碑.md).
Gameplay scope of the derivative: task-driven dispatch, train-set based traction/braking,
freight, coupling/uncoupling, and UI; all original MTR content/logic is retained.
